WEBVTT

00:04.350 --> 00:05.970
You see, that house...

00:07.050 --> 00:09.440
It's on the edge of the residential area,

00:09.860 --> 00:12.950
and it was built by one of 
the most prominent nobles

00:13.630 --> 00:17.900
in the Kingdom of Ceasarion, 
Lord Midnight, for his servants.

00:18.590 --> 00:21.250
But ever since it was left unoccupied,

00:21.590 --> 00:24.930
people have heard screams and things
moving in the middle of the night.

00:24.930 --> 00:28.170
A number of creepy rumors 
about the house have spread.

00:28.490 --> 00:32.670
It seems an evil spirit, 
a wraith, is haunting the place.

