<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

02:17.990 --> 02:20.950
<b>Episode 4</b>

02:17.990 --> 02:20.950
<b>The Big Plan for the Home</b>

02:17.990 --> 02:20.950
<b>of the Ikusaba Brother and Sister</b>

02:23.490 --> 02:25.910
Oh! If it isn't Asahi-kun!

02:25.910 --> 02:28.660
What kind of quest do you... Huh?

02:28.660 --> 02:30.970
That look and the way you're acting...

02:30.970 --> 02:32.380
Uh-huh. I see.

02:33.060 --> 02:35.840
You ran out of money for 
lodgings again, didn't you?

02:35.840 --> 02:38.620
Well, yes, pretty much.

02:38.620 --> 02:43.590
So if you could find me a 
profitable quest with a <i>huge</i> reward...

02:44.000 --> 02:48.600
Asahi-kun, you and your sister have been 
staying in inns since you came to town, right?

02:48.600 --> 02:52.030
Right. And for multiple nights at a time.

02:52.030 --> 02:54.840
If only we had a base of operations...

02:54.820 --> 02:57.320
<b>Base</b>

02:54.840 --> 02:57.340
It's an essential part of MMOs, after all.

02:57.940 --> 03:00.770
Then do I have the job for you, Asahi-kun!

03:00.770 --> 03:01.560
Huh?

03:01.560 --> 03:03.950
It's a request from a noble family.

03:03.950 --> 03:06.120
And would you believe it? The reward is...

03:06.120 --> 03:13.380
<b>TA-DA!</b>

03:07.130 --> 03:09.360
You get a house!

03:09.360 --> 03:11.420
A house? It's my dream to own a home!

03:11.420 --> 03:13.380
Nobles are amazing! They're Amaze-Nobles!

03:13.980 --> 03:17.860
Of course, the request 
isn't exactly super simple...

03:18.270 --> 03:21.130
But what do you think? Wanna take it on?

03:21.630 --> 03:24.240
I'll do it! Of course I will!

03:24.240 --> 03:25.640
Roger that.

03:25.640 --> 03:27.520
Um, why are you smiling like that?

03:28.370 --> 03:30.430
Well, then. Put your all into...

03:30.970 --> 03:32.390
exorcising the evil spirit.

03:32.990 --> 03:36.900
Huh? Evil spirit? By "evil spirit," 
do you mean <i>that</i> kind of evil spirit?

03:36.900 --> 03:39.110
Of course! That kind of evil spirit!

03:38.400 --> 03:42.780
Evil

03:38.400 --> 03:42.780
Evil

03:38.400 --> 03:42.780
Spirit

03:38.400 --> 03:42.780
Spirit

03:39.110 --> 03:40.260
R-Really?

03:40.260 --> 03:41.790
What are you scared of?

03:41.790 --> 03:44.320
With your abilities, it'll be super easy!

03:42.780 --> 03:46.910
Evil

03:42.780 --> 03:46.910
Evil

03:42.780 --> 03:46.910
Spirit

03:42.780 --> 03:46.910
Spirit

03:44.320 --> 03:46.910
Just use your overwhelming 
strength to force it out!

03:47.320 --> 03:49.160
I see. An evil spirit, huh?

03:49.690 --> 03:53.140
Yup, but I think Tanya's exaggerating.

03:53.140 --> 03:56.100
I mean, something as dated as a ghost...

03:56.100 --> 04:00.970
But this is a different world. Stuff we find 
illogical might not seem so strange here.

04:00.970 --> 04:02.630
It's likely a homeless guy,

04:02.630 --> 04:07.260
or someone who's been run out of town living 
there without permission. That's what we'll—

04:09.150 --> 04:12.870
You're so <i>cute</i> when you're scared, Asahi!

04:12.870 --> 04:15.150
D-D-Don't scare me like that!

04:17.150 --> 04:20.250
Hey, why don't we do this tomorrow 
instead, after the sun's come up?

04:20.250 --> 04:22.640
But evil spirits come out at night, don't they?

04:22.640 --> 04:26.180
We'd have no reason to go to the manor
 if the evil spirit won't show itself.

04:26.180 --> 04:28.660
Yes. You make a good point.

04:29.290 --> 04:34.120
But just think: once we boot out 
this evil spirit, we get the house.

04:34.120 --> 04:36.260
It's absolutely perfect, isn't it?

04:36.260 --> 04:40.590
B-But a string of high-ranked 
clerics have tried and failed,

04:40.590 --> 04:42.590
s-so the Guild didn't know what to do.

04:43.680 --> 04:45.050
This reminds me of that time...

04:45.380 --> 04:48.260
you played a horror game 
where you explore a mansion,

04:48.260 --> 04:50.740
and you couldn't go to 
the bathroom alone after.

04:50.740 --> 04:52.140
H-Hey!

04:52.140 --> 04:54.520
Oneechan, come with me!

04:54.520 --> 04:57.250
A mummy in a wheelchair 
is gonna chase me!

04:57.250 --> 04:59.690
There, there. That's a good boy.

04:59.690 --> 05:01.650
Hey! Stop that! Stop!

05:01.650 --> 05:04.300
Th-That was a long time ago.

05:04.300 --> 05:06.160
Ghosts and monsters...

05:06.440 --> 05:09.690
I'm not scared of all that 
paranormal stuff anymore.

05:15.770 --> 05:18.230
Asahi, that's just regular lightning.

05:18.230 --> 05:21.380
It wasn't aimed at us. Everything's all right.

05:26.670 --> 05:29.180
I've known you for fifteen years now.

05:29.180 --> 05:32.850
Of <i>course</i> I'm gonna know
 you don't like ghosts.

05:33.590 --> 05:36.780
You don't have to pretend you're fine
around your big sister.

05:36.780 --> 05:37.850
Thanks.

05:38.580 --> 05:39.920
Now, let's go.

05:40.540 --> 05:41.340
Right.

05:44.310 --> 05:46.560
I think we're almost there.

05:48.320 --> 05:52.560
Don't let there be ghosts. Don't let there 
be ghosts. Don't let there be ghosts.

05:52.560 --> 05:53.660
Don't let there be—

06:05.100 --> 06:07.270
Oh, it was just a cat.

06:07.270 --> 06:09.340
Asahi... I can't... breathe!

06:09.340 --> 06:10.830
Ah! S-Sorry!

06:23.680 --> 06:26.320
O-Okay, I'm gonna go open the door.

06:27.060 --> 06:28.240
Bring it on!

06:36.860 --> 06:38.040
Asahi!

06:39.580 --> 06:42.500
Could it be...

06:42.770 --> 06:44.710
Leave this place.

06:44.710 --> 06:48.840
If you value your lives, 
leave this place now!

06:49.060 --> 06:52.120
Energy Drain? Is that one 
of the evil spirit's skills?

06:54.340 --> 06:56.970
It is just as you say, young man.

06:56.970 --> 07:01.190
I completely absorb the life force 
of anyone who enters this house.

07:01.720 --> 07:03.190
Then, I'll try!

07:03.400 --> 07:05.940
Don't! Maya-nee, it'll drain 
your strength from you!

07:08.350 --> 07:12.950
Fool. I will drain your life force
 until all that's left are dregs.

07:14.290 --> 07:15.990
What sweet life energy!

07:15.990 --> 07:17.190
Maya-nee...

07:18.200 --> 07:18.950
H-Huh?

07:23.670 --> 07:26.000
<i>It couldn't absorb all of her 
energy, so it threw up?!</i>

07:26.580 --> 07:27.460
Excuse us!

07:27.680 --> 07:30.490
<i>My sister's capacity is insane.</i>

07:32.990 --> 07:37.310
It needs a good clean, 
but it's fully furnished.

07:37.680 --> 07:38.340
Yup.

07:39.750 --> 07:41.230
It's a very nice house.

07:41.560 --> 07:45.230
Yeah. And it's more than big enough 
for the two of us to live in.

07:45.470 --> 07:46.610
Slurp.

07:47.010 --> 07:49.290
At the inn, we had to be 
considerate of others,

07:49.290 --> 07:51.650
but in a stand-alone house,
we can do what we like!

07:51.650 --> 07:55.070
Seriously?! Why are you thinking
stuff that's scarier than the wraith?!

07:55.530 --> 07:59.600
Honestly. By the way, isn't there 
anything you're scared of, Maya-nee?

08:00.090 --> 08:02.960
Me? I'm not really scared of anything.

08:04.750 --> 08:07.460
Oh, now that I think about it, 
there is <i>one</i> thing.

08:07.460 --> 08:09.260
Really? What is it?

08:09.260 --> 08:11.720
<i>This is my chance to exploit
 Maya-nee's weakness!</i>

08:13.130 --> 08:14.200
It is...

08:15.720 --> 08:16.720
my little brother.

08:16.720 --> 08:18.310
My little brother's so scary!

08:18.310 --> 08:24.230
Is he gonna pounce on me? Is he gonna 
drive me into a corner? Just imagining it is...

08:24.720 --> 08:27.110
Don't tell such transparent lies!

08:27.110 --> 08:31.100
I'm telling you now, even if we move into 
our own house, pouncing on me is forbidden!

08:33.870 --> 08:35.590
This is where you say, "Fine."

08:36.380 --> 08:38.630
So what happened to the evil spirit?

08:38.630 --> 08:40.950
Don't switch back to 
serious topics so suddenly!

08:41.470 --> 08:44.240
It wouldn't have crossed over 
after that encounter, would it?

08:44.750 --> 08:46.870
I-It'd be nice if it had, but...

08:47.830 --> 08:50.040
It might be hiding somewhere.

08:50.040 --> 08:51.460
M-Maya-nee?

08:52.710 --> 08:57.220
At first glance, nothing seems
 out of the ordinary, but...

08:58.720 --> 09:02.310
We're not gonna have to deal with
poltergeist activity or whatever, are we?

09:07.850 --> 09:08.810
Asahi!

09:08.810 --> 09:09.690
Here!

09:10.990 --> 09:13.640
Are you all right? 
Drink this potion and recover.

09:13.640 --> 09:15.280
Uh, thanks.

09:15.450 --> 09:18.260
I didn't think there'd 
actually be a poltergeist.

09:18.780 --> 09:20.370
Be careful, Asahi.

09:26.790 --> 09:27.420
Asahi!

09:27.420 --> 09:28.290
Here!

09:29.000 --> 09:32.720
Are you all right, Asahi? Drink this 
high potion to heal your wounds.

09:33.480 --> 09:34.920
Thanks.

09:36.380 --> 09:40.010
Be careful, Asahi. This must be 
the evil spirit harassing us.

09:40.010 --> 09:41.760
What's gonna happen next?

09:49.710 --> 09:52.860
<i>Oh, it's so fluffy!</i>

09:53.400 --> 09:54.740
Asahi!

09:54.960 --> 09:55.610
Here!

09:56.670 --> 09:59.270
Now, drink this Last Elixir.

10:01.410 --> 10:04.140
Maya-nee! That's too much 
healing for the damage I took!

10:04.140 --> 10:08.020
I-It is? I was so worried about you,
I couldn't help myself.

10:09.330 --> 10:15.180
<i>Being overprotective and buying all these 
healing items is why we ran out of money.</i>

10:16.810 --> 10:18.480
That evil spirit...

10:19.340 --> 10:24.080
Cease these cowardly attacks. 
Show yourself and fight us properly!

10:27.860 --> 10:29.790
Well, if you insist.

10:29.790 --> 10:32.570
I shall face you in person.

10:34.690 --> 10:36.930
It's here!

10:36.930 --> 10:39.410
Wait! No! It was just a knee-jerk reaction—

10:39.950 --> 10:43.370
Suddenly clinging to me?
What a dirty-minded little brother!

10:44.610 --> 10:45.910
Can't breathe!

10:46.180 --> 10:47.660
You two...

10:48.450 --> 10:50.870
Don't call me out, then ignore me!

10:55.270 --> 10:57.920
She dissipated that attack with just a kiai?

10:57.920 --> 11:01.760
How dare you scare my dear little brother...

11:01.930 --> 11:04.100
<b>Glint</b>

11:02.810 --> 11:04.180
Certain death awaits you!

11:04.690 --> 11:06.570
<i>Don't use that line, Maya-nee.</i>

11:06.570 --> 11:09.510
But, uh, I'm already dead.

11:11.270 --> 11:12.960
Prepare yourself, evil spirit!

11:12.960 --> 11:15.520
My magic shall make you 
ascend to the heavens!

11:15.520 --> 11:18.190
Hang on, Maya-nee.
Don't destroy the building, okay?

11:18.880 --> 11:21.290
<i>Th-This is bad. At this rate...</i>

11:23.400 --> 11:24.340
Boom!

11:24.340 --> 11:28.580
<i>...the house'll get blown up, we'll be stuck
with the debt, and we'll have to work underground!</i>

11:28.580 --> 11:31.210
<i>I know a ton about 
those kinds of storylines.</i>

11:32.350 --> 11:37.000
I can feel it. I can feel this 
woman's tremendous power.

11:37.000 --> 11:41.070
It rivals that of one of the Demon King's 
Six Generals, the Ruler of the Underworld!

11:41.070 --> 11:42.200
However...

11:45.570 --> 11:49.930
All that means is I need 
to take over this body!

11:50.260 --> 11:51.100
What?

11:51.350 --> 11:52.190
Maya-nee?

11:56.210 --> 11:58.990
Stay out of my body!

11:58.990 --> 12:00.250
Maya-nee?

12:12.490 --> 12:14.000
I have obtained...

12:14.810 --> 12:17.720
the most powerful body.

