12:19.000 --> 12:22.000
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

12:28.430 --> 12:34.900
I have it! I have obtained 
the strongest body!

12:38.150 --> 12:40.410
I'm overflowing with power.

12:43.530 --> 12:46.490
This body is incredible.

12:47.290 --> 12:49.340
<i>This is bad. Seriously bad.</i>

12:49.340 --> 12:53.000
<i>If Maya-nee's might has fallen 
into the wrong hands, then...</i>

13:17.790 --> 13:21.140
<i>It means not only am I in danger,
 but so is the whole world.</i>

13:22.270 --> 13:23.770
<i>I need some kind of plan.</i>

13:27.320 --> 13:28.030
Escape!

13:38.710 --> 13:39.990
<i>Which way do I run?</i>

13:40.500 --> 13:42.560
<i>The entrance? The second floor?</i>

13:42.560 --> 13:44.710
<i>If I use Escape, I should be able to...</i>

13:45.070 --> 13:46.280
<i>What do I do?</i>

13:47.060 --> 13:48.370
<i>What do I do?</i>

13:49.970 --> 13:51.250
<i>What do I do?</i>

13:55.280 --> 13:56.660
<i>I can't run away.</i>

13:59.260 --> 14:01.690
<i>If I leave things like this, 
Maya-nee will...</i>

14:06.850 --> 14:08.490
Maya-nee, come to your senses!

14:08.490 --> 14:11.530
It's me! It's Asahi! You know that, right?

14:13.240 --> 14:15.250
Maya-nee!

14:18.270 --> 14:20.810
I've been looking for you, Ikusaba siblings.

14:20.810 --> 14:21.960
Huh?

14:21.960 --> 14:26.090
What's wrong with you two?
You're looking all serious.

14:26.090 --> 14:27.840
Sibling spat?

14:27.840 --> 14:31.090
Kilmaria! Right. Kilmaria might be able to...

14:31.340 --> 14:32.760
K-Kilmaria!

14:34.250 --> 14:36.420
Well, you see, blah blah, yadda yadda...

14:36.420 --> 14:40.260
I see. Who would've thought 
something so delightful would happen?

14:40.260 --> 14:42.110
It's not delightful at all.

14:43.530 --> 14:45.960
This is truly pathetic, Maya.

14:45.960 --> 14:48.950
My rival, allowing a wraith...

14:48.950 --> 14:49.930
a nobody...

14:49.930 --> 14:51.910
to take over her body?

14:53.070 --> 14:55.580
<i>Did the evil spirit get angry 
at being called a nobody?</i>

14:55.900 --> 14:58.260
That flagging determination of yours...

14:58.770 --> 15:01.880
I'll beat it back into shape!

15:01.880 --> 15:03.640
Wait!

15:05.300 --> 15:07.300
Wh... Wh-Wh-What is this?

15:07.300 --> 15:10.430
Please don't fight a serious 
battle inside this house!

15:10.430 --> 15:11.760
I'm begging you!

15:12.320 --> 15:14.800
A-All right! I understand, so, uh...

15:15.080 --> 15:17.750
C-Could you move your hand?

15:20.830 --> 15:21.690
I'm sorry!

15:22.190 --> 15:25.570
Taking advantage of the 
confusion to fondle me...

15:27.150 --> 15:28.400
<b>Blush</b>

15:27.150 --> 15:28.400
You're a naughty young man.

15:28.400 --> 15:29.780
Y-You've got it all wrong!

15:29.780 --> 15:32.280
I-It was one of those acts of nature...

15:35.610 --> 15:38.500
Her aura's gotten even stronger!

15:38.500 --> 15:43.000
Drawing on this much of the vessel's
 power... This wraith is impressive.

15:43.260 --> 15:44.860
In which case...

15:44.860 --> 15:47.420
We shall challenge it with this!

15:53.850 --> 15:55.780
Wh-What are you gonna do?

15:55.780 --> 15:57.260
Arm wrestling.

15:57.260 --> 15:58.820
A-Arm wrestling?

15:58.820 --> 16:02.850
That's right. I'll beat it in a contest 
of strength and it will lose confidence.

16:02.850 --> 16:06.610
And that opening will allow me to 
expel the evil spirit from Maya's body.

16:06.610 --> 16:07.610
What?

16:07.610 --> 16:08.630
A brilliant idea, yes?

16:08.630 --> 16:10.320
I-Is it?

16:12.250 --> 16:13.820
What's wrong?

16:14.380 --> 16:18.830
Are you so afraid of losing to me
that you can't even compete?

16:22.410 --> 16:27.290
Well, then. Ready...

16:28.970 --> 16:33.130
Go!

16:48.690 --> 16:50.070
I told them...

16:50.670 --> 16:52.220
I told them, didn't I?

16:54.190 --> 16:57.660
I told them not to destroy the house!

16:57.660 --> 16:59.860
Very good, Ikusaba Maya.

16:59.860 --> 17:04.160
You are truly the one with 
the potential to satisfy me!

17:04.410 --> 17:07.830
To think you're capable of this much 
even when controlled by a wraith...

17:11.230 --> 17:13.090
No, I see what's going on.

17:17.190 --> 17:19.440
But that's entertaining in its own way!

17:19.830 --> 17:24.520
I shall apply my full 
strength to this contest!

17:28.650 --> 17:31.860
<b>Ruuumble</b>

17:49.880 --> 17:53.030
Man, that went totally 
beyond just arm wrestling.

17:55.500 --> 17:57.550
Wh-Which one won?

18:09.480 --> 18:11.840
<i>Sh-She's so strong.</i>

