19:28.670 --> 19:33.290
I was nearly possessed, but it seems
 I was the more powerful one.

19:33.290 --> 19:35.520
Like I said, your capacity is just...

19:36.470 --> 19:42.500
The half-naked horned woman noticed 
I was just pretending to be controlled.

19:44.560 --> 19:45.910
Pretending?

19:45.910 --> 19:49.750
Don't play pranks like that! 
I was seriously worried.

19:49.750 --> 19:52.090
I said I was sorry.

19:52.550 --> 19:53.500
But you know...

19:53.720 --> 19:54.790
