20:04.040 --> 20:06.380
Stop messing around.

20:06.380 --> 20:08.180
We expelled the evil spirit,

20:08.180 --> 20:11.360
so we need to hurry back
 to the Guild to report it.

20:11.360 --> 20:12.440
